note bottom
This ERD is the complete target relational model for the finished AI CRM Automation system.
`ReviewTask.lead_id` is nullable. Non-Lead review targets use `target_entity_type` + `target_entity_id`; because the pair is polymorphic and has no native FK, backend enforcement validates both fields together, an allowlisted type, target existence, authorization, policy, idempotency and audit.
`CustomerTask` is the separate operational task model for retention, feedback escalation and account follow-up; `ReviewTask` is for explicit review/approval. Enforce task source/type constraints and idempotency.
One Customer may be referenced by many Leads through `converted_customer_id`; do not add uniqueness on that FK.
Churn bands: 0–39 LOW, 40–69 MEDIUM, 70–100 HIGH; insufficient data is `INSUFFICIENT_DATA`. Account Health weights: interaction recency 30%, feedback 25%, open issue severity/status 25%, follow-up completion 20%; normalize only with at least two meaningful components.
Quote prices/tax/discounts are calculated by backend policy; `QuoteItem` snapshots preserve the accepted price. Transcript text is redacted before AI processing.
end note
